      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to complete every goal cell in each level. A goal is completed by stepping onto its cell only when the carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal\u2019s required attributes; completing all goals advances to the next level, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (north/south/east/west) costs 1 stamina and cannot be made in any direction listed in blocked_directions (walls/impassable). If stamina reaches 0, you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max; losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape tiles cycle shape 0\u20135, color tiles cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation tiles rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920). A goal cell becomes activated only when shape+color+rotation all match; then stepping onto that goal completes it."
      }
